Hello,
I'm trying to run irace with a dummy example using both a runner and evaluator but I'm facing an assertion error :

# 2017-04-21 11:58:47 CEST: End of iteration 2
5: traceback(1)
4: irace.assert(sum(nrow(iraceResults$experimentLog)) == experimentsUsedSoFar)
3: irace(scenario = scenario, parameters = parameters)
2: irace.main(scenario)
1: irace.cmdline()
Error in irace.assert(sum(nrow(iraceResults$experimentLog)) == experimentsUsedSoFar) :
 sum(nrow(iraceResults$experimentLog)) == experimentsUsedSoFar is not TRUE
An unexpected condition occurred. Please report this bug to the authors of the irace package <http://iridia.ulb.ac.be/irace <http://iridia.ulb.ac.be/irace>>

