Minimal code to reproduce it:

└> # cat target-evaluator
#!/bin/bash
echo $(( $RANDOM % 10 ))
exit 0

└> # cat target-runner
#!/bin/bash
exit 0

└> # cat parameters.txt
### Parameter file for the ACOTSP software
# name          switch               type       values                  [conditions (using R syntax)]
