Dear Zimmer,

Thanks for reporting this. Please see the recent thread started by Johannes
Maschler.

In a nutshell, the assert is detecting that experimentLog is not updated
correctly. This is just a log that can be used for further analysis, if you
don't use it there is no bug. You may either comment out the assert, downgrade
to irace 2.1 (but experimentLog may be also wrong there) or wait a few days
until we release a version fixed in CRAN.

Cheers,

Manuel.

